%%slide_ref @vaswani2017attention Vaswani et al.: Attention Is All You Need, NeurIPS, 2017.
%%slide_ref @brown2020gpt3 Brown et al.: Language Models are Few-Shot Learners, NeurIPS, 2020.
%%slide_ref @chen2021codex Chen et al.: Evaluating Large Language Models Trained on Code, 2021.
